~C. Both texts use the same rhetorical choice because they support repairs.#Incorrect. This choice does not accurately connect the evidence, reasoning, or rhetorical effect required by the question.
~D. Text B is ineffective because it lacks inspection records.#Incorrect. This choice does not accurately connect the evidence, reasoning, or rhetorical effect required by the question.
}

